't take it along","v":13},{"k":"Switched to fibre","v":49},{"k":"Didn't use it enough","v":22}],"involService":37.8,"involMoney":51.6,"involN":188,"lowUseService":51.6,"lowUseN":31,"valueInvol":65.5,"otherInvol":37.9,"themes":[{"k":"Slow at busy hours","all":409,"det":185},{"k":"Weak signal indoors","all":362,"det":208},{"k":"Price","all":282,"det":133},{"k":"Slow support / fix","all":27,"det":16},{"k":"Router problems","all":21,"det":14},{"k":"Payment hassle","all":25,"det":19},{"k":"Moved house","all":9,"det":8},{"k":"Fibre competitor","all":33,"det":27},{"k":"Rarely used","all":12,"det":11},{"k":"Works well","all":888,"det":0},{"k":"5G is faster","all":152,"det":0}],"quotes":[{"theme":"Slow at busy hours","id":"FWA-001830","type":"Onboarding","nps":6,"text":"Habis magrib susah buat video call","en":"Hard to make video calls after sunset","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Metro","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Slow at busy hours","id":"FWA-001566","type":"Relationship","nps":5,"text":"Jam 7 sampai 10 malam kecepatan turun drastis. Kalau begini terus mau berhenti.","en":"Speed drops sharply from 7 to 10 pm. If it stays like this I'll quit.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Suburban","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Slow at busy hours","id":"FWA-002591","type":"Onboarding","nps":5,"text":"Pas semua orang di rumah pakai, langsung lemot. Kalau begini terus mau berhenti.","en":"As soon as everyone at home is online, it crawls. If it stays like this I'll quit.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Suburban","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Slow at busy hours","id":"FWA-000892","type":"Exit","nps":6,"text":"Pagi kencang, sore sampai malam lambat sekali. Kalau begini terus mau berhenti.","en":"Fast in the morning, very slow from afternoon to night. If it stays like this I'll quit.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Metro","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Weak signal indoors","id":"FWA-000801","type":"Onboarding","nps":4,"text":"Di kamar belakang tidak dapat sinyal sama sekali. Harusnya bisa lebih baik.","en":"No signal at all in the back room. It should be better.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Suburban","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Weak signal indoors","id":"FWA-001254","type":"Relationship","nps":4,"text":"Di lantai dua lumayan, di bawah hampir tidak bisa","en":"Upstairs is OK, downstairs barely works","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Metro","channel":"Online"},{"theme":"Weak signal indoors","id":"FWA-004214","type":"Onboarding","nps":4,"text":"Sinyal naik turun, sering putus sendiri. Kecewa sih.","en":"Signal goes up and down and keeps dropping. Pretty disappointing.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Urban","channel":"Partner agent"},{"theme":"Weak signal indoors","id":"FWA-000784","type":"Relationship","nps":5,"text":"Sinyal di dalam rumah lemah, modem harus ditaruh dekat jendela. Kalau begini terus mau berhenti.","en":"Weak signal inside, the router has to sit by the window. If it stays like this I'll quit.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Rural","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Price","id":"FWA-004348","type":"Exit","nps":5,"text":"Promo cuma di awal, setelah itu mahal. Kalau begini terus mau berhenti.","en":"The promo is only at the start, then it gets expensive. If it stays like this I'll quit.","plan":"4G 50 Mbps","area":"Rural","channel":"Field sales"},{"theme":"Price","id":"FWA-001013","type":"Relationship","nps":5,"text":"Untuk pemakaian saya, harganya kurang sepadan","en":"For how much I use it, it isn't worth the price","plan":"4G 50 Mbps","area":"Urban","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Price","id":"FWA-003449","type":"Onboarding","nps":6,"text":"Gaji pas-pasan, kadang telat beli paket. Sudah lapor tapi belum ada perubahan.","en":"Money is tight, sometimes I buy the package late. Reported it already, nothing changed.","plan":"4G 20 Mbps","area":"Urban","channel":"Retail outlet"},{"theme":"Price","id":"FWA-001224","type":"Relationship","nps":6,"text":"Harganya agak mahal untuk kecepatan segini. Harusnya bisa lebih baik.","en":"A